.TH "Docv::Markup" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::Markup \- What page text is beyond its rendition.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv"\fR
.sp
\fBenum Docv::Markup\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
What page text is beyond its rendition. A parser sets it; the viewer
draws marked text in a role (\fB\%Viewer::MARKUP_ROLES\fR).
.SH "ENUM MEMBERS"
.PP
\fBNone = 0_u8\fR
.TP 4
