A horizontal rule.
.TP 4
\fBImage = 5_u8\fR
The text standing for an image.
.TP 4
\fBSyntaxKeyword = 6_u8\fR
Syntax of highlighted code (\fB\%Syntax::CAPTURES\fR).
.PP
\fBSyntaxString = 7_u8\fR
.PP
